        "attached to EVPlayer2 pid={} (memory scan only, no injection)",
        harvester.pid()
    ));

    let client = reqwest::blocking::Client::builder()
        .user_agent("restclient-cpp")
        .timeout(Duration::from_secs(60))
        .build()?;

    let started = Instant::now();
